          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeire Musa agambira abantu ati, “Mukozire entambara mpango. Mbwenu ndatemba ow'Omukama, rundi nakwatilira entambara yanyu egyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Mua agaruka ow'Omukama, agamba ati, “Ai bambi, abantu aba bakozire entambara mpango, bakora ruhanga w'ezahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu osinge obagaruliire entambara yabo egyo. Kakitali kityo nintagiliza banfute omu kitabo kyawe ekyo ohandikiremu amabara g'abantu bawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Omukama amugambira ati, “Weena wena anfakaliire ndamufuta omu kitabo kyange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu ogende, otware abantu mbali nkugambire. Omumalaika wange aragenda akwebembeire. Hamoi n'ebyo ekiro ekyo ndaija ndababonabonyia aha rw'entambara yabo egyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
